            BEFORE THE NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION

 IN THE MATTER OF THE APPLICATION OF                       )
 EL PASO ELECTRIC COMPANY FOR                              )
 REVISION OF ITS RETAIL ELECTRIC RATES                     )   Docket No. 25-00082-UT
 PURSUANT TO ADVICE NOTICE NO. 317                         )

                     ORDER ESTABLISHING OFFICIAL SERVICE LIST

       THIS MATTER comes before hearing examiners Elizabeth C. Hurst and Jocelyn Barrett

pursuant to 1.2.2.10(B)(4) NMAC. The Hearing Examiners FIND and CONCLUDE THAT:

       1.      On June 5, 2026, El Paso Electric Company filed the Declaration of Michelle A.

Pedroza confirming compliance with the Procedural Order regarding mailing, publication, and

posting of the Notice Customers on EPE’s website.

       2.      The deadline for intervention expired on June 22, 2026.

       3.      An Official Service List should be issued for this docket.

       IT IS THEREFORE ORDERED: The Official Service List is hereby established. Effective

immediately and subject to future amendments, service of pleadings and other documents shall be

made upon the parties listed on the attached Certificate of Service. Parties shall ensure their contact

information is entered in the PRCe360 Case Management System to receive service notifications.

       ISSUED under the Seal of the Commission at Santa Fe, New Mexico, on June 26, 2026.
          BEFORE THE NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION

